    <briefdescription>
<para>A class to store a CUDA stream along with a few information to avoid CUDA queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It contains<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the stream itself,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a unique id (proper to CUDASTF, and only valid for streams in our pool, or equal to -1),</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the pool associated to the unique ID, when valid</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the device index in which the stream is </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
